WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.350
- What's up, Netflix Geeked.

00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:03.900
I'm Emily from the new
Netflix series, One Piece

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:06.388
and this is "Growing Up Geeked".

00:00:06.388 --> 00:00:08.550
(exciting music)

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:10.050
I grew up on Dragon Ball Z.

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:12.480
I grew up on Pokémon, Yu-Gi-Oh!

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:15.450
I saw Spirited Away in
theaters when it came out here

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:16.283
in the States.

00:00:16.283 --> 00:00:20.790
So all of the anime stuff, that
made me into who I am, 100%.

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:24.714
Sailor Moon, I made my parents
rent the Sailor Moon movie

00:00:24.714 --> 00:00:27.990
all the time and they were so sick of it,

00:00:27.990 --> 00:00:29.790
but I was just like,"Oh my gosh.

00:00:29.790 --> 00:00:33.330
Women are so cool and so powerful
and they can do anything."

00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:37.980
And it also just really
solidified anime in my life.

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:40.230
There are a lot of things
that I'm obsessed with.

00:00:40.230 --> 00:00:43.170
I have been rereading One Piece

00:00:43.170 --> 00:00:46.590
and then I have also been
watching Demon Slayer

00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:48.150
'cause that's currently coming out.

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:49.620
Of course, so good.

00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:52.920
And then I'm just constantly
on the hunt for more animes

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:54.480
that I haven't already seen.

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:58.290
I wish I hadn't gotten
rid of my Pokémon cards

00:00:58.290 --> 00:00:59.970
and my Game Boy Color with all

00:00:59.970 --> 00:01:02.100
of the original Pokémon Games.

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:05.190
I have beat myself up over that so much

00:01:05.190 --> 00:01:06.180
because I'm like, "Why?

00:01:06.180 --> 00:01:07.290
Why did I do that?"

00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:08.123
That was amazing.

00:01:08.123 --> 00:01:09.570
Like, I wanna play them now, you know?

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:11.010
I wanna have those cards now.

00:01:11.010 --> 00:01:13.680
But, you know, live and learn, I guess.

00:01:13.680 --> 00:01:18.680
It is so hard to choose one
TV show or movie or video game

00:01:18.990 --> 00:01:21.900
because there's amalgamation
of all of those things

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:23.730
that changed my life.

00:01:23.730 --> 00:01:26.580
Please make sure to check
out One Piece on Netflix.

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:27.810
You'll have to excuse them.

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:28.643
They're idiots.

00:01:28.643 --> 00:01:30.547
- Oh, oh. (yells)

00:01:34.491 --> 00:01:37.006
(atmospheric sounds)

